Third-party licenses for the OCIDex binaries in this image.

LICENSE         OCIDex's own license (MIT).
go/             The Go standard library and runtime, linked into every binary. This
                also covers the golang.org/x packages the standard library vendors.
Apache-2.0.txt  The full Apache License 2.0. Some modules below ship only the short
                Apache notice in their LICENSE file; this is the license it refers to.
<module path>/  One directory per linked third-party module, holding its license
                files. Modules under the Mozilla Public License 2.0 also carry their
                source, as the MPL requires.

The source of every Go module is available from the Go module proxy at
https://proxy.golang.org/<module>/@v/<version>.zip.
